  "text": "CUCA AI ROBOT Global Agent Expansion Platform\nCUCA AI ROBOT\nHome\nAbout\nProducts\nRental Hosting\nAgents\nFranchise\nServices\nAccount\nAI Staff\n文A\nEnglish\n▾\nLogin\nRegister\nJoin Now\nGlobal Agent Expansion System\nFrom regional ops to national HQ — build a global AI robot agent network\n\nCUCA AI ROBOT centers on Regional, City and National agents, combined with product mall, 3-level distribution, personal websites, AI staff and franchise stores — a scalable platform business system.\n\nView Agent Levels\nView Growth Path\n3 Tiers\nAgent System\n10% + 2% + 1%\nSales Commission\nPersonal Site\nIndependent Promotion\nAI Staff\nAuto Acquisition\nCUCA\nGLOBAL\nRegional\nCity\nNational\nMall Sales Commission\n10% / 2% / 1%\nAI Marketing System\nOnline\nNational · Regional · City Agent System\n\nFrom regional operations to national market layout — a scalable platform system.\n\nTeam Expansion\nRegional Agent\nRegional Agent\nUSD 100,000\nBonus: 100,000 company shares*\n10%\nDirect\n2%\nLevel 1\n1%\nLevel 2\nRegional recruitment with 3-level rewards\nCompany co-pilot, training and operations support\nGifts and marketing materials\nRegional website and AI staff\nManage multiple cities and team systems\nKey Market\nLocal Market\nCity Agent\nCity Agent\nUSD 500,000\nBonus: 500,000 company shares*\n10%\nDirect\n2%\nLevel 1\n1%\nLevel 2\nRecruit regional agents with 3-level rewards\nDevelop franchisees and hosting clients\nCompany co-pilot, gifts and materials\nPersonal website and AI agent staff\nStrategic Partner\nNational Agent\nNational Agent\nUSD 1,000,000\nBonus: 2,000,000 company shares*\n10%\nDirect\n2%\nLevel 1\n1%\nLevel 2\nRecruit city agents with 3-level rewards\nLead national market and chain expansion\nNational website and AI staff\nBuild national operations HQ\nThree-Level Market Expansion Path\n\nOne Platform · Three Growth Levels\n\nRegional Agent\n\nScale teams with training, recruitment, live streaming and regional ops.\n\nCity Agent\n\nBuild city systems — stores, hosting business and regional agents.\n\nNational Agent\n\nBuild national HQ — brand, agents, franchise stores and nationwide markets.\n\nSix HQ Enablement Supports\n\nHelp agents launch fast, replicate teams and expand markets.\n\n🌐\nPersonal Website\n🤖\nAI Staff\n🎥\nVideo Assets\n🎁\nGift Support\n📦\nMarketing Materials\n🚀\nCompany Co-pilot\n3-Level Sales Commission Model\n\nApplies to qualifying real product orders in the robot mall.\n\n1\nDirect Referral\n\n10%\n\n2\nLevel 1\n\n2%\n\n3\nLevel 2\n\n1%\n\n4\nBackend Settlement\n\nOrders and commissions are recorded by the system.\n\nImportant Compliance Notice:This page is a marketing UI illustration of the agent plan. Agent fees, commissions, share grants, distribution tiers, reward conditions and settlement methods are subject to official company policies, board approvals, share grant documents, sales contracts and applicable laws. Shares do not guarantee listing, liquidity, appreciation or buyback. Commissions must be based on real product sales or service transactions, not primarily on recruiting people.\nChoose Your CUCA Agent Level\n\nGet official agent materials, contracts and market launch plans.\n\nSubmit Agent ApplicationAI Customer Service\nCUCA AI ROBOT\n\nGlobal AI robot sales, rental hosting, agents and wellness center entrepreneurship platform.\n\nAgent System\n\nRegional Agent\nCity Agent\nNational Agent\n\nHQ Support\n\nPersonal Website\nAI Staff\nMarketing Materials\nCompany Co-pilot\n\nPlatform Business\n\nProduct Mall\nRental Hosting\nFranchise",
