x-[18px] py-2.5 rounded-full text-cuca-dark font-black bg-gradient-btn\">Join Now</a><button type=\"button\" class=\"xl:hidden px-3 py-2 rounded-lg border border-white/15 text-sm\" aria-label=\"Menu\">Menu</button></div><!----></nav><main><div class=\"agents-page\"><header class=\"ag-hero\"><div><span class=\"badge\">Global Agent Expansion System</span><h1 class=\"ag-h1\">From regional ops to national HQ — build a <span class=\"gradient-text\">global AI robot agent network</span></h1><p class=\"ag-desc\">CUCA AI ROBOT centers on Regional, City and National agents, combined with product mall, 3-level distribution, personal websites, AI staff and franchise stores — a scalable platform business system.</p><div class=\"flex gap-3.5 flex-wrap mb-8\"><a href=\"#levels\" class=\"btn-primary\">View Agent Levels</a><a href=\"#path\" class=\"btn-dark\">View Growth Path</a></div><div class=\"ag-kpis\"><div class=\"ag-kpi\"><b>3 Tiers</b> Agent System</div><div class=\"ag-kpi\"><b>10% + 2% + 1%</b> Sales Commission</div><div class=\"ag-kpi\"><b>Personal Site</b> Independent Promotion</div><div class=\"ag-kpi\"><b>AI Staff</b> Auto Acquisition</div></div></div><div class=\"ag-visual\"><div class=\"ag-network\"><div class=\"ag-core\"> CUCA<br>GLOBAL </div><div class=\"ag-node ag-n1\">Regional</div><div class=\"ag-node ag-n2\">City</div><div class=\"ag-node ag-n3\">National</div></div><div class=\"ag-metric\"><span>Mall Sales Commission</span><b class=\"\">10% / 2% / 1%</b></div><div class=\"ag-metric\"><span>AI Marketing System</span><b class=\"text-cuca-green\">Online</b></div></div></header><section id=\"levels\" class=\"ag-section\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-[38px] leading-tight mb-2.5 max-lg:text-3xl\">National · Regional · City Agent System</h2><p class=\"text-[#aebbd0] text-[17px]\">From regional operations to national market layout — a scalable platform system.</p></div><div class=\"ag-levels\"><div class=\"ag-level\"><!----><span class=\"ag-pill\">Team Expansion</span><h3>Regional Agent</h3><div class=\"ag-en\">Regional Agent</div><div class=\"ag-fee\">USD 100,000</div><div class=\"ag-stock\">Bonus: 100,000 company shares*</div><div class=\"ag-commission\"><div><b>10%</b> Direct</div><div><b>2%</b> Level 1</div><div><b>1%</b> Level 2</div></div><ul><li>Regional recruitment with 3-level rewards</li><li>Company co-pilot, training and operations support</li><li>Gifts and marketing materials</li><li>Regional website and AI staff</li><li>Manage multiple cities and team systems</li></ul></div><div class=\"ag-level ag-level-featured\"><div class=\"ag-ribbon\">Key Market</div><span class=\"ag-pill\">Local Market</span><h3>City Agent</h3><div class=\"ag-en\">City Agent</div><div class=\"ag-fee\">USD 500,000</div><div class=\"ag-stock\">Bonus: 500,000 company shares*</div><div class=\"ag-commission\"><div><b>10%</b> Direct</div><div><b>2%</b> Level 1</div><div><b>1%</b> Level 2</div></div><ul><li>Recruit regional agents with 3-level rewards</li><li>Develop franchisees and hosting clients</li><li>Company co-pilot, gifts and materials</li><li>Personal website and AI agent staff</li></ul></div><div class=\"ag-level\"><!----><span class=\"ag-pill\">Strategic Partner</span><h3>National Agent</h3><div class=\"ag-en\">National Agent</div><div class=\"ag-fee\">USD 1,000,000</div><div class=\"ag-stock\">Bonus: 2,000,000 company shares*</div><div class=\"ag-commission\"><div><b>10%</b> Direct</div><div><b>2%</b> Level 1</div><div><b>1%</b> Level 2</div></div><ul><li>Recruit city agents with 3-level rewards</li><li>Lead national market and chain expansion</li><li>National website and AI staff</li><li>Build national operations HQ</li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"path\" class=\"ag-section ag-dark\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-[38px] leading-tight mb-2.5 max-lg:text-3xl\">Three-Level Market Expansion Path</h2><p class=\"text-[#aebbd0] text-[17px]\">One Platform · Three Growth Levels</p></div><div class=\"ag-path\"><div class=\"ag-path-card\"><h3>Regional Agent</h3><p>Scale teams with training, recruitment, live streaming and regional ops.</p></div><div class=\"ag-path-card\"><h3>City Agent</h3><p>Build city systems — stores, hosting business and regional agents.</p></div><div class=\"ag-path-card\"><h3>National Agent</h3><p>Build national HQ — brand, agents, franchise stores and nationwide markets.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ag-section\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-[38px] leading-tight mb-2.5 max-lg:text-3xl\">Six HQ Enablement Supports</h2><p class=\"text-[#aebbd0] text-[17px]\">Help agents launch fast, replicate teams and expand markets.</p></div><div class=\"ag-support-grid\"><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">🌐</div><b>Personal Website</b></div><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">🤖</div><b>AI Staff</b></div><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">🎥</div><b>Video Assets</b></div><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">🎁</div><b>Gift Support</b></div><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">📦</div><b>Marketing Materials</b></div><div class=\"ag-support\"><div class=\"ag-ico\">🚀</div><b>Company Co-pilot</b></div></div></section><section class=\"ag-section ag-dark\"><div class=\"mb-10 text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-[38px] leading-tight mb-2.5 max-lg:text-3xl\">3-Level Sales Commission Model</h2><p class=\"text-[#aebbd0] text-[17px]\">Applies to qualifying real product orders in the robot mall.</p></div><div class=\"ag-flow\"><div class=\"ag-step\"><div class=\"ag-num\">1</div><h3>Direct Referral</h3><p><b class=\"text-cuca-green text-2xl\">10%</b></p></div><div class=\"ag-step\"><div class=\"ag-num\">2</div><h3>Level 1</h3><p><b class=\"text-cuca-green text-2xl\">2%</b></p></div><div class=\"ag-step\"><div class=\"ag-num\">3</div><h3>Level 2</h3><p><b class=\"text-cuca-green text-2xl\">1%</b></p></div><div class=\"ag-step\"><div class=\"ag-num\">4</div><h3>Backend Settlement</h3><p class=\"text-[#cbd5e1] text-sm\">Orders and commissions are recorded by the system.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"ag-section\"><div class=\"ag-notice\"><strong>Important Compliance Notice:</strong>This page is a marketing UI illustration of the agent plan. Agent fees, commissions, share grants, distribution tiers, reward conditions and settlement methods are subject to official company policies, board approvals, share grant documents, sales contracts and applicable laws. Shares do not guarantee listing, liquidity, appreciation or buyback. Commissions must be based on real product sales or service transactions, not primarily on recruiting people.</div></section><div id=\"apply\" class=\"ag-cta\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-black\">Choose Your CUCA Agent Level</h2><p class=\"text-[#cbd5e1] my-3 mb-5\">Get official agent materials, contracts and market launch plans.</p><a href=\"/en/apply/agent\" class=\"btn-primary\">Submit Agent Application</a><a href=\"#\" class=\"btn-dark ml-3\">AI Customer Service</a></div><footer class=\"ag-footer\"><div><div class=\"logo-text mb-3\">CUCA AI ROBOT</div><p>Global AI robot sales, rental hosting, agents and wellness center entrepreneurship platform.</p></div><div><b class=\"text-white\">Agent System</b><p class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><span class=\"block\">Regional Agent</span><span class=\"block\">City Agent</span><span class=\"block\">National Agent</span></p></div><div><b class=\"text-white\">HQ Support</b><p class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><span class=\"block\">Personal Website</span><span class=\"block\">AI Staff</span><span class=\"block\">Marketing Materials</span><span class=\"block\">Company Co-pilot</span></p></div><div><b class=\"text-white\">Platform Business</b><p class=\"mt-2 space-y-1\"><span class=\"block\">Product Mall</span><span class=\"block\">Rental Hosting</span><span class=\"block\">Franchise</span></p></div></footer></div></main></div></div><div id=\"teleports\"></div><script>window.__NUXT__={};window.__N